<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Vendor Assessment Request</title>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f7fa;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .email-container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .email-body {
      padding: 20px 30px;
    }

    .email-body p {
      margin: 15px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
    }

    .highlight {
      background-color: #f1f9ff;
      padding: 10px;
      border-left: 4px solid #0073e6;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .button-link {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      background-color: #0073e6;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .button-link:hover {
      background-color: #005bb5;
    }

    .details h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #084179;
    }

    .details p {
      margin: 3px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
    }

    .details a {
      color: #0073e6;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .details a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .assessment-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .assessment-table td {
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      padding: 8px;
      color: #555;
    }

    .assessment-table td:first-child {
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      color: #333;
      font-weight: bold;
      width: 40%;
    }

    .email-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
    }

    .green-line {
      width: 4px;
      background-color: #00b050;
      align-self: stretch;
      margin-right: 15px;
    }

    .footer-content {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .company-logo img {
      max-width: 75px;
      height: auto;
      margin-right: 15px;
    }

    .automated-note {
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6b7280;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="email-container">

    <!-- Body Section -->
    <div class="email-body">
      <p>Dear <strong><%= leadResponderName || 'Third Party Responder' %></strong>,</p>

      <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Vendor Assessment Request</p>

      <p>
        I hope this letter finds you well. We appreciate the ongoing partnership between our companies
        and the valuable products/services that your company provides. As part of our commitment to
        maintaining the highest quality and standards, we periodically conduct vendor assessments to
        ensure compliance, efficiency, and quality control.
      </p>

      <p>
        You have been assigned a third-party assessment by
        <strong><%= userCompanyName || 'the organization' %></strong>.
        We have decided to conduct this assessment to foster mutual growth and drive meaningful
        improvements together.
      </p>

      <!-- Company Reference -->
      <div class="details highlight">
        <h2>Company Reference</h2>
        <p><%= userCompanyName || '-' %></p>
        <p><%= userCompanyAddress || '-' %></p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:<%= userEmail || '' %>"><%= userEmail || '-' %></a></p>
        <p>Contact: <%= userContactNumber || '-' %></p>
      </div>

      <!-- Assessment Details -->
      <table class="assessment-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
        <tr>
          <td>Third Party Name</td>
          <td><%= thirdPartyName || '-' %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Third Party Type</td>
          <td><%= thirdPartyType || '-' %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Assessment</td>
          <td><%= scheduleTitle || assessmentId || '-' %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Assessment Due Date</td>
          <td>
            <% if (assessmentDueDate) { %>
              <%= new Date(assessmentDueDate).toLocaleDateString() %>
            <% } else { %>
              -
            <% } %>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Submission Due Date</td>
          <td>
            <% if (submissionDueDate) { %>
              <%= new Date(submissionDueDate).toLocaleDateString() %>
            <% } else { %>
              -
            <% } %>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Review Due Date</td>
          <td>
            <% if (reviewDueDate) { %>
              <%= new Date(reviewDueDate).toLocaleDateString() %>
            <% } else { %>
              -
            <% } %>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <p>
        We are providing access to our portal to complete the questionnaire. Login and password
        details may be sent in separate emails.
      </p>

      <% if (loginLink) { %>
        <p style="text-align:center;">
          <a href="<%= loginLink %>" class="button-link">
            Open Assessment Portal
          </a>
        </p>
      <% } %>

      <p>
        The assessment will encompass various aspects of our partnership, including quality assurance,
        supply chain efficiency, contractual terms compliance, and an overall business relationship
        assessment. We believe this assessment will help identify areas where we can collaborate to
        optimize operations and enhance the service quality we provide our customers.
      </p>

      <p>I appreciate your cooperation.</p>

      <p>Best Regards,</p>

      <p>
        <strong><%= leadReviewerName || '-' %></strong><br />
        <%= leadReviewerTitle || 'Lead Reviewer' %><br />
        Email: <%= leadReviewerEmail || '-' %> |
        Contact: <%= leadReviewerContactNumber || '-' %>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Section -->
    <div class="email-footer">
      <div class="green-line"></div>

      <div class="footer-content">
        <% if (companyLogoUrl) { %>
          <div class="company-logo">
            <img src="<%= companyLogoUrl %>" alt="Company Logo" />
          </div>
        <% } %>

        <div class="details">
          <h2><%= userCompanyName || 'TPRM Team' %></h2>
          <p><%= userCompanyAddress || '-' %></p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:<%= userEmail || '' %>"><%= userEmail || '-' %></a></p>
          <p>Contact: <%= userContactNumber || '-' %></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="automated-note">
      This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly to this message.
    </div>

  </div>
</body>

</html>

